# src/lb_tree.c via src/lb_owner.py n --bin=lb_tree: every connected core, every ranking profile, every sequence of insertion choices (LB's R1 order). runs = complete runs; over = runs needing the overflow bundle; r_bad = r (last-processed non-upgraded agent) not a valid owner; r_bad_lastmin = r_bad and the last insertion had minimal lookahead count (ties allowed); any_bad = no valid owner at all; lb_runs_r_bad = r_bad in LB's own run; r_bad_allmin = r_bad with every insertion count-minimal. The 'ex' lines are runs with r_bad_lastmin (attempts/lb-last-insertion-lookahead.md).
